`resolve_json` walks EVERY string in a config schema, `"default"` values
included, and this plugin has a locale key genuinely named `HOME`. So the default
is rewritten to the translation, and the setting the user ends up with differs by
UI language — with no rebuild and nothing to tell the author.

Note what makes this an error and `pass/dollar-literals`' `"$HOME/notes"` a note:
the collision, not the shape. `$$HOME` is the escape.
